Package: sctofactorgen
Type: Package
Title: Convert SurveyCTO Labels to R Factors
Version: 0.1.2
Author: Benjamin Mazzotta
Maintainer: Benjamin Mazzotta <bmazzotta@bfaglobal.com>
Description: Convert SurveyCTO question and choice labels into R variable
    labels and factors. Read downloaded Excel form definitions and CSV response
    exports without API access, or optionally download them with 'rsurveycto'.
    Supports single-language forms with non-repeating single-select questions
    and expanded multiple-select response columns.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: 
    dplyr,
    haven,
    janitor,
    labelled,
    magrittr,
    purrr,
    readxl,
    stringr,
    tibble,
    tidyr
Suggests: 
    rsurveycto,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tidyverse
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://benmazzotta.github.io/sctofactorgen/
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
